---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import siteConfig from '../data/site.config.json';
---
<BaseLayout title={`Privacy policy | ${siteConfig.siteName}`} description="Privacy policy">
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 1.5rem; max-width: 720px;">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>This policy covers the personal data collected through the contact/quote forms on this website.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you submit a form, we collect the name, phone number, email address and message you provide, along with the page (city and service) you submitted it from.</p>
    <h2>How it's used</h2>
    <p>This information is used solely to respond to your enquiry and provide a quote. It is sent by email to our team and is not sold or shared with third parties beyond what is needed to deliver that email.</p>
    <h2>Spam protection</h2>
    <p>Form submissions are checked with Cloudflare Turnstile, a privacy-friendly bot-detection service, before being processed.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>This site does not currently use tracking cookies or third-party analytics.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>To ask about the data we hold or request its deletion, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
